tially broken experience, I've decided to focus on making the Windows launch as stable as possible. Linux support may return in a future update , once these issues have been properly addressed and tested. I'm sorry for the inco","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T22:38:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114043136","verified_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5075540-1846651706682489","game_id":"steam-5075540","kind":"announcement","title":"In That Case... is participating in Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Hey everyone!In That Case... is officially taking part in Steam Next Fest, October 19–26!If you haven't tried the game yet, now's a great time to jump into the free demo.You'll get to experience a slice of story mode, learn the ropes of opening cases, managing your money and debt, and surviving the growing threat of the descending ceiling spikes. It's a taste of the chaos waiting for you in the full game. The full game launches October 30, 2026, just a few days after Next Fest ends! If you enjoy","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T17:17:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706682489","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:39:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5075540-1844115010503009","game_id":"steam-5075540","kind":"announcement","title":"In That Case... — Launch Content & 2027 Roadmap","summary":"Hello! I'm MontaiL, the solo developer behind Studio MontaiL.As you may have already seen, In That Case... officially releases October 30th, just in time for Halloween.With release getting closer, I wanted to go over exactly what the game will ship with, what you can expect from Story and Endless Mode, and what I have planned going into 2027.1. Launch Content & ModesIn That Case... launches with both Story Mode and Endless Mode, fully playable from start to finish.The game comes with a large var","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-22T03:29:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010503009","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:39:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5075540-1842846814449204","game_id":"steam-5075540","kind":"update","title":"Dev Update/Newsletter September","summary":"I haven't done these in a while. The game is coming together well, as of a week or so the main STORY MODE is complete and functions as more of a context and tutorial for ENDLESS MODE which is now under full focus development. With story mode behind, endless mode unlocks the ability to well, play endlessly. You step into the shoes of an employee gone rogue facing punishment for your actions, enjoy playtesting your own prototype. As that might be the last thing you do. ENDLESS mode features a whol","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-05T14:57:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814449204","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:39:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5075540":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:06Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:05Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5075540":"2026-10-26T08:00:06Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5075540":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:05Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:05Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:05Z"},"5076750":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:06Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:06Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_f